ame":"evidence/branch-consolidation-followup-20261114/native-collector-history-v1/tree-1-bed92c9c2d2c71398a516ecbfea3ca272f703cec.raw","status":"added","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changes":0,"blob_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/blob/5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f/evidence%2Fbranch-consolidation-followup-20261114%2Fnative-collector-history-v1%2Ftree-1-bed92c9c2d2c71398a516ecbfea3ca272f703cec.raw","raw_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/raw/5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f/evidence%2Fbranch-consolidation-followup-20261114%2Fnative-collector-history-v1%2Ftree-1-bed92c9c2d2c71398a516ecbfea3ca272f703cec.raw","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/contents/evidence%2Fbranch-consolidation-followup-20261114%2Fnative-collector-history-v1%2Ftree-1-bed92c9c2d2c71398a516ecbfea3ca272f703cec.raw?ref=5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f"},{"sha":"d27a702527516a8c4b7e23bdc2ebe1d216685b1f","filename":"evidence/branch-consolidation-followup-20261114/native-collector-history-v1/tree-2-520f3d47f1625e7894a8ce981739304308b47b46.raw","status":"added","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changes":0,"blob_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/blob/5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f/evidence%2Fbranch-consolidation-followup-20261114%2Fnative-collector-history-v1%2Ftree-2-520f3d47f1625e7894a8ce981739304308b47b46.raw","raw_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/raw/5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f/evidence%2Fbranch-consolidation-followup-20261114%2Fnative-collector-history-v1%2Ftree-2-520f3d47f1625e7894a8ce981739304308b47b46.raw","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/contents/evidence%2Fbranch-consolidation-followup-20261114%2Fnative-collector-history-v1%2Ftree-2-520f3d47f1625e7894a8ce981739304308b47b46.raw?ref=5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f"},{"sha":"42f67acdc9a4dafb2c55343a0fe0b0583f6345c4","filename":"evidence/branch-consolidation-followup-20261114/source-binding-integration-v1/README.md","status":"added","additions":27,"deletions":0,"changes":27,"blob_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/blob/5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f/evidence%2Fbranch-consolidation-followup-20261114%2Fsource-binding-integration-v1%2FREADME.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/raw/5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f/evidence%2Fbranch-consolidation-followup-20261114%2Fsource-binding-integration-v1%2FREADME.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/contents/evidence%2Fbranch-consolidation-followup-20261114%2Fsource-binding-integration-v1%2FREADME.md?ref=5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@\n+# Reviewed source-binding follow-up integration\n+\n+The original complete repository-truth lane on 7d8d4c59 failed; the subsequent\n+122-unit continuation diagnostic completed with 116 zero and six nonzero exits.\n+It is diagnostic evidence, not a passing original full lane.\n+\n+- [Original diagnostic summary](diagnostics-original-summary.json)\n+- [Complete original diagnostic ZIP](diagnostics.zip)\n+- [Exact ZIP member index](diagnostics-index.json)\n+- [Cross-host copy verification](diagnostics-copy-verification.json)\n+- [Integration decisions and original carrier identities](integration-review.json)\n+\n+The ZIP contains 266 original files plus its index. Original stdout, stderr,\n+command bodies, timing, source records and failure exits are preserved.\n+The four reviewed component commits are H1 e811c204, F1 2d9baf31, F2 6418023d\n+and B1 341a8b5f. Their local controls and explicit qualification boundaries\n+remain separate from any later exact-source complete lane or hosted result.\n+\n+The current corpus changes only twelve existing reviewed blob pins and adds\n+one required raw historical collector dependency. The historical joint Markdown\n+document keeps its original bytes under a .md.original carrier; its original\n+index and file remain available at the F2 commit. No current Markdown checker\n+exception is added. No native runtime or original acceptance limit is changed.\n+\n+The source commit which contains this integration cannot contain its own later\n+complete gate receipts. Those are collected separately with the actual head,\n+tree, original outputs and source readbacks before any publication decision."},{"sha":"8baa51ae9e3af0b3afc01ac8e5fbad6c97e22186","filename":"evidence/branch-consolidation-followup-20261114/source-binding-integration-v1/diagnostics-copy-verification.json","status":"added","additions":220,"deletions":0,"changes":220,"blob_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/blob/5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f/evidence%2Fbranch-consolidation-followup-20261114%2Fsource-binding-integration-v1%2Fdiagnostics-copy-verification.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/raw/5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f/evidence%2Fbranch-consolidation-followup-20261114%2Fsource-binding-integration-v1%2Fdiagnostics-copy-verification.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/contents/evidence%2Fbranch-consolidation-followup-20261114%2Fsource-binding-integration-v1%2Fdiagnostics-copy-verification.json?ref=5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,220 @@\n+{\n+  \"all_member_raw_bytes_already_verified_on_rog\": true,\n+  \"chunks\": [\n+    {\n+      \"chunk_sha256\": \"792f2dd53c749bf862003df01135134e47df780e34f09a15290a95f58f4ce47c\",\n+      \"eof\": false,\n+      \"file\": 0,\n+      \"next_offset\": 65535,\n+      \"offset\": 0,\n+      \"path\": \"/home/qian-qi/chain-final-consolidation-20261114-root/remaining-repository-truth-diagnostics-7d8d4c-package-v1/original-diagnostics-7d