2b855\"\n+      },\n+      \"timeout_seconds\": 120\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"working_source_changed_only_by_reviewed_patch\": true\n+}"},{"sha":"43cb688e5a9b88b9e17d4f5e331ce70d0b45e440","filename":"evidence/pon-fixed-joint-source-binding-20261114/README.md","status":"added","additions":7,"deletions":0,"changes":7,"blob_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/blob/5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f/evidence%2Fpon-fixed-joint-source-binding-20261114%2FREADME.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/raw/5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f/evidence%2Fpon-fixed-joint-source-binding-20261114%2FREADME.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/contents/evidence%2Fpon-fixed-joint-source-binding-20261114%2FREADME.md?ref=5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@\n+# Reviewed fixed-probability and joint source mappings\n+\n+This evidence preserves the original source mappings and failed observations.\n+[F1](f1/README.md) reviews the one changed input in the existing four-file MU1\n+relation-source contract. The joint mapping will use a real source checkpoint\n+that already contains the F1 child contract. No mathematical premise or\n+qualification is promoted; all production and native-risk claims remain open."},{"sha":"c13da69cb34c5a7bc2426e4ee71075d16b5f7da7","filename":"evidence/pon-fixed-joint-source-binding-20261114/f1/EVIDENCE_INDEX.json","status":"added","additions":183,"deletions":0,"changes":183,"blob_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/blob/5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f/evidence%2Fpon-fixed-joint-source-binding-20261114%2Ff1%2FEVIDENCE_INDEX.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/raw/5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f/evidence%2Fpon-fixed-joint-source-binding-20261114%2Ff1%2FEVIDENCE_INDEX.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tr