n+    {\n+      \"bytes\": 0,\n+      \"path\": \"original-diagnostics/unit-010-lines-78-78.stdout\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"bytes\": 0,\n+      \"path\": \"original-diagnostics/unit-022-lines-90-90.stderr\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"bytes\": 175,\n+      \"path\": \"original-diagnostics/unit-022-lines-90-90.stdout\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"1feeea04b855e9e8f575d9a904d0971c83c7ee5239ab3eefca75357c63fcc8f2\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"bytes\": 68677,\n+      \"path\": \"original-diagnostics/unit-023-lines-91-91.stderr\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"546e228268abc5820ef0aa44749a73d20c92c29655d12cd32300f9f7747d2430\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"bytes\": 0,\n+      \"path\": \"original-diagnostics/unit-023-lines-91-91.stdout\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"qualification_granted\": false,\n+  \"schema\": \"fixed-joint-f1-evidence-index-v1\",\n+  \"scope\": \"Originals and targeted F1 validation only; source consistency does not grant qualification.\",\n+  \"source_checkpoint\": \"7d8d4c59fcd01480a12e1c64835b202079091800\"\n+}"},{"sha":"b7049527e00c7716727270f874716e40c80f745d","filename":"evidence/pon-fixed-joint-source-binding-20261114/f1/README.md","status":"added","additions":27,"deletions":0,"changes":27,"blob_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/blob/5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f/evidence%2Fpon-fixed-joint-source-binding-20261114%2Ff1%2FREADME.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/raw/5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f/evidence%2Fpon-fixed-joint-source-binding-20261114%2Ff1%2FREADME.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/contents/evidence%2Fpon-fixed-joint-source-binding-20261114%2Ff1%2FREADME.md?ref=5df7ae6f482157c5f7fdcbcd52222117a965053f","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@\n+# F1: reviewed current MU1 relation-source mapping\n+\n+The sole active contract change is one reviewed `pon_work.rs` digest in the\n+existing four-path source set. The other three source hashes, original reader,\n+all 16 original control methods, relation probability 1/16, research credit 16u,\n+context, accounting, strategy roster and open obligations remain unchanged.\n+\n+The old contract's four pins match Git source 2bb56596e637908c44b5a2ef5984c9c37c7d3cc8.\n+The reviewed current sources are at 7d8d4c59fcd01480a12e1c64835b202079091800.\n+These are source checkpoints, not the later metadata commit identity.\n+The original JSON is retained under ../historical and the complete selected\n+source diff is under source-review. Nine raw original diagnostic files under\n+../original-diagnostics preserve the full 122-command summary and the specified\n+fixed/joint failures, without relabeling those failures as success.\n+\n+## Targeted validation\n+\n+The unchanged 16 methods passed on macOS with the recorded Python command.\n+The actual default reader reported binding_validation=PASS and\n+qualification=HOLD_NO_GO, with 16 unknown cost points. A separate direct call\n+to the same production reader rejected the original contract against current\n+sources with SOURCE_DIGEST_MISMATCH. Seven explicitly listed inputs matched\n+before and after validation. Exact commands and raw streams are in validation.\n+\n+These targeted source/claim-boundary controls do not execute native Rust work,\n+establish a cost lower bound, or replace the successor full Linux lane or hosted\n+CI. All qualification and activation flags remain false/HOLD."},{"sha":"959ef964c2e40eb373f3642f25a9b27c158e3e48","filename":"evidence/pon-fixed-joint-source-binding-20261114/f1/setup/branch-rule-recovery-summary.json","status":"added","additions":132,"deletions":0,"changes":132,"blob_url":"https://github.com/Trillionniu